Creates a circle of radius [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] at your feet; the circle slows incoming projectiles by [55%, 74%, 89%, 101%, 112% (TL1-5; SP 100)] and attempts to push all creatures other than yourself out of its radius, inflicting [11, 15, 18, 20, 23 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage and [11, 15, 18, 20, 23 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage per turn as it does so.  The circle lasts [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

The effects will increase with your Spellpower.
